# CodeAlpha - Image Gallery

A responsive, interactive image gallery built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript as part of the CodeAlpha Frontend Development Internship.

## Features

- **Responsive Layout:** Grid layout adapting across mobile, tablet, and desktop screens.
- **Category Filter:** Filter images by categories (Nature, City, Tech).
- **Lightbox Viewer:** Enlarged image view with Next and Previous navigation controls.
- **Image Upload:** Local file upload integration to preview custom images in the gallery.

## Tech Stack

- HTML5
- CSS3 (Flexbox, Grid, Glassmorphism UI)
- Vanilla JavaScript (DOM Manipulation, Event Delegation)
